<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA FARMA'S DIVIDEND TO BE 1.5 EEK SHARE.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA FARMA'S DIVIDEND TO BE 1.5 EEK SHARE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Farma said on Monday that it will propose to its annual general meeting to pay a dividend of 1.5 kroons.</p>
<p>The proposal included paying the dividend by July 31 and the list of share holders is to be fixed on April 30, the pharmaceutical company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Tallinna Farma will hold its share holders meeting on April 14.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
